Package: mitmproxy
Version: 12.3.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: python, python-pip, python-cryptography, python-brotli, python-bcrypt, build-essential, libffi
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/mitmproxy/mitmproxy
Description: Interactive TLS-capable intercepting HTTP proxy
 mitmproxy is a set of tools that provide an interactive, SSL/TLS-capable
 intercepting proxy for HTTP/1, HTTP/2, and WebSockets. It ships a console
 interface (mitmproxy), a command-line tool (mitmdump) and a web UI (mitmweb).
 Works without root in explicit proxy mode on Termux.
